<view class="page stack"><view class="title">选择适合你的营养师</view><view class="subtitle">首版提供资料浏览和匹配申请，不含在线支付或聊天。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="dietitian card"><view class="name">{{item.display_name}}</view><view class="credentials">{{item.credentials}}</view><view class="tags"><text wx:for="{{item.specialties}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</text></view><view class="bio">{{item.bio}}</view><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="request">申请匹配</button></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty">营养师资料正在完善中。</view></view>
